# #1736 row 1 for a task that detaches ITSELF (task_detach of task_self) and
# dies a slice later: detached is detached, whoever set it. Main's first yield
# returns (the task only detached and yielded); its second is the stop.
# Expected: "MAIN_AFTER_FIRST_YIELD", the trace, rc 1, and NO "MARK_END".
define selfdie() as:
    task_detach of (task_self of null)
    task_yield of null
    missing
d is task_spawn of selfdie
task_yield of null
print of "MAIN_AFTER_FIRST_YIELD"
task_yield of null
print of "MARK_END"
